            <ArticleTitle>Magnetic Resonance Imaging of Abdominal and Pelvic Pain in the Pregnant Patient.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>403-17</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.mric.2015.11.007</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S1064-9689(15)00171-3</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The utility of MR imaging in evaluating abdominal and pelvic pain in the pregnant patient is discussed. Details regarding the indications, technical aspects, and imaging findings of various common abdominal and pelvic abnormalities in pregnancy are reviewed.</AbstractText>
